{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfies the equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/69901902dcd9b06dbc419b8bba3cd7551bd9b2ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}x-8=\\frac{2}{5}x-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd5ff28c3227370b82304170e4e3344562652273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  x=-\\frac{7}{40} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  x=\\frac{2}{7} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  x=\\frac{40}{7} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  x=-\\frac{40}{7} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  x=\\frac{360}{7} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"651\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to get rid of the fractions, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/65985c9238b0129c28cf2a459321f1a5b9e95fc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20(\\frac{3}{4}x - 8) = 20(\\frac{2}{5}x - 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/a/fbacefc36265ba3a429b8cd20c6a4be6b1239171.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15x - 160 = 8x - 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"173\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/9/8e9885b9f73cafdd81507a48f40146dc885863c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15x - 8x = -200 + 160$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"187\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/51682f8503b2b271a13a7449aef4f8b86a333b46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x = -40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/3/e036a7c07c400ae88b4af7cf9808005b8f4f26ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } x = -\\frac{40}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"120\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"202